        "original_id": "85c1f252-ce36-57c3-9df2-8dbe27dcf5a0",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Matt Ryan, John Constantine, Daniel Cerone, David S. Goyer\n- Roles: Edward Kenway\n- Organizations: NBC, The CW, Ubisoft, DC Comics\n- Products: Constantine, Arrow, Justice League Dark\n- Topics: Welsh actors, American television series\n\nFacts:\n- Matt Ryan was born as Matthew Darren Evans on 11 April 1981.\n- Matt Ryan is a Welsh actor from Swansea.\n- Matt Ryan is best known for playing Edward Kenway in a Ubisoft video game.\n- Matt Ryan played John Constantine in the NBC series Constantine.\n- Matt Ryan played John Constantine in The CW series Arrow.\n- Matt Ryan voiced John Constantine in the 2017 film Justice League Dark.\n- Constantine is an American television series for NBC.\n- Constantine was developed by Daniel Cerone and David S. Goyer.\n- Constantine features the DC Comics character John Constantine.",
